*  MINIMAL WITNESS (s184, batch B, from MDY.sno): a pattern carrying an
*  IMMEDIATE value assignment ($) and a DEFERRED PREDICATE CALL WITH ARGS
*  (*GT(DY,X)) reading the just-assigned variable SIGSEGVs SCRIP in BOTH
*  modes.  In MDY.sno itself the same construct SIGSEGVs mode 3 while MODE 4
*  RUNS THE WHOLE DRIVER CORRECTLY, so the crash is also reachable as a 1:1
*  divergence.  Same family as beauty's grammar and BLANKS's
*  LEN(*DIFF(N,' ')) -- a deferred call with arguments inside a pattern --
*  so this is a second independent witness for the M1 class.
	I  =  SPAN('0123456789')
	DY =  83
	P  =  '(' I $ X *GT(DY,X) ',' I $ M
	T  =  '(334,12)(31,2)(0,1)'
	T  P					:F(GDP_F)
	OUTPUT  =  X ' ' M			:(END)
GDP_F	OUTPUT  =  'NO MATCH'
END
